update_rule.pseudocode:
each day if mandate_active:
  for each person visit in location requiring masks:
    compliance_prob = min(1, enforcement_rate * location.enforcement_strictness * person.policy_influence_sensitivity * person.trust_in_authority)
    comply = Bernoulli(compliance_prob)
    if not comply:
      if Bernoulli(enforcement_rate * location.enforcement_strictness):
        issue warning or fine with prob proportional to fine_amount
        record enforcement action
    compliance.immediate_by_person[person] = comply
  else:
    compliance.immediate_by_person[person] = None
  enforcement.actions_today = count of warnings + fines
